332-recruits-under-esi-scheme/articleshow/134713522.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134713522.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Chief Minister Pushkar Singh Dhami on Monday distributed appointment letters to 332 newly recruited personnel, including 271 appointees in the AYUSH Department and 61 Allopathic Pharmacy Officers under the Employees' State Insurance (ESI) Scheme, at an event held at the Mukhya Sevak Sadan at the Chief Minister's Camp Office.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/uttarakhand-cm-dhami-hands-over-appointment-letters-to-332-recruits-under-esi-scheme/articleshow/134713522.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/uttarakhand-cm-dhami-hands-over-appointment-letters-to-332-recruits-under-esi-scheme/articleshow/134713522.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-05T22:49:46+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134713521,imgsize-183442.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Muslim outreach or message to Akhilesh? How Imran Masood's 'elevation' will test Congress-SP alliance in UP]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/muslim-outreach-or-message-to-akhilesh-how-imran-masoods-elevation-will-test-congress-sp-alliance-in-up/articleshow/134711884.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134711884.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In Uttar Pradesh, Congress is setting the stage for the 2027 assembly elections amidst complicated alliance dynamics with the Samajwadi Party. The selection of Imran Masood as state chief has ignited concerns about Congress's approach to the alliance and the contentious seat-sharing talks. Masood's clear statements on the party's electoral strategy suggest underlying tensions that might define their coalition's effectiveness in challenging the BJP.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/muslim-outreach-or-message-to-akhilesh-how-imran-masoods-elevation-will-test-congress-sp-alliance-in-up/articleshow/134711884.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/muslim-outreach-or-message-to-akhilesh-how-imran-masoods-elevation-will-test-congress-sp-alliance-in-up/articleshow/134711884.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-05T22:05:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kunal Varma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134712652,imgsize-72556.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bypolls in 5 assembly constituencies, 1 Lok Sabha seat tomorrow: Key contests to watch]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bypolls-in-5-assembly-constituencies-1-lok-sabha-seat-tomorrow-key-contests-to-watch/articleshow/134712421.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134712421.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bypolls-in-5-assembly-constituencies-1-lok-sabha-seat-tomorrow-key-contests-to-watch/articleshow/134712421.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bypolls-in-5-assembly-constituencies-1-lok-sabha-seat-tomorrow-key-contests-to-watch/articleshow/134712421.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-05T22:02:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134712471,imgsize-204624.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Misled the public': BJP rejects Rahul Gandhi’s 'illegal' claims on Form 6 and SIR]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/misled-the-public-bjp-rejects-rahul-gandhis-illegal-cla